  "description": "Tae-seong, a physical therapist stuck in his monotonous routine, ends up causing a car accident. He promises to fully compensate the victim, Gyo-yeon, who takes advantage of Tae-seong’s offer. As Tae-seong finds himself increasingly drawn to Gyo-yeon, who lives a life completely opposite his own, he tries to keep his distance. But Gyo-yeon shows up at Tae-seong’s workplace…\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059174)",
